{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/php/ip_check/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<p>실 서버 유지보수 작업 시 유용합니다.<br>\nif문 안에 있는 내용은 설정된 IP 내에서만 보여집니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"php\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-php line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-php\"><span class=\"token php language-php\"><span class=\"token delimiter important\">&lt;?</span> <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token variable\">$_SERVER</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string single-quoted-string\">'REMOTE_ADDR'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token operator\">==</span><span class=\"token string single-quoted-string\">'아이피'</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span> <span class=\"token delimiter important\">?></span></span>\r\n  특정 IP에서만 노출됩니다.\r\n<span class=\"token php language-php\"><span class=\"token delimiter important\">&lt;?</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span> <span class=\"token delimiter important\">?></span></span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>","tableOfContents":"","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 12, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"[PHP] 특정 IP 에서만 노출","summary":"실 서버 유지보수 작업 시 유용합니다. if문 안에 있는 내용은 설정된 IP 내에서만 보여집니다. <? if($_SERVER[\"REMOTE_ADDR\"]==\"아이피\") { ?> 특정 IP에서만 노출됩니다. <? } ?>","date":"Mar 10, 2021","categories":["PHP"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/php/ip_check/","prev":{"slug":"/pages/about/","title":"About, Text and Typography"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/css/flexbox/","title":"[CSS] Flexbox"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}